# AGENTS.md

Project context for coding agents (Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Copilot, ...).
Keep this short and current.

Coding standards and behavioral guidelines live in
[`agents/CODING_RULES.md`](agents/CODING_RULES.md) — they apply to every
session and every role.

